{
    "id": "ontology-modeling",
    "title": {
        "en": "Ontology modeling assistant",
        "zh": "本体建模助手"
    },
    "description": {
        "en": "Conversational assistant that turns a description or an uploaded document into a complete ontology TBox JSON.",
        "zh": "根据说明或上传文件，多轮生成可直接采用的本体概念与关系 JSON。"
    },
    "canvas_type": "Agent",
    "canvas_types": [
        "Agent"
    ],
    "dsl": {
        "components": {
            "begin": {
                "downstream": [
                    "Agent:OntologyModeler"
                ],
                "obj": {
                    "component_name": "Begin",
                    "params": {
                        "enablePrologue": true,
                        "inputs": {},
                        "mode": "conversational",
                        "prologue": "说明要建的本体，或上传制度、台账、清册等文件。我会返回完整的概念与关系，供建模页采用。"
                    }
                },
                "upstream": []
            },
            "Agent:OntologyModeler": {
                "downstream": [
                    "Message:OntologySchema"
                ],
                "obj": {
                    "component_name": "Agent",
                    "params": {
                        "cite": false,
                        "delay_after_error": 1,
                        "description": "",
                        "exception_comment": "",
                        "exception_default_value": "",
                        "exception_goto": [],
                        "exception_method": null,
                        "frequencyPenaltyEnabled": false,
                        "frequency_penalty": 0.5,
                        "llm_id": "",
                        "maxTokensEnabled": false,
                        "max_retries": 3,
                        "max_rounds": 1,
                        "max_tokens": 8192,
                        "mcp": [],
                        "message_history_window_size": 12,
                        "outputs": {
                            "content": {
                                "type": "string",
                                "value": ""
                            }
                        },
                        "parameter": "Precise",
                        "presencePenaltyEnabled": false,
                        "presence_penalty": 0.5,
                        "prompts": [
                            {
                                "role": "user",
                                "content": "{sys.query}"
                            }
                        ],
                        "sys_prompt": "你是本体建模助手。依据用户说明、对话中给出的当前本体，以及附件正文，输出当前完整 TBox。\n\n【规则】\n1. 只输出一个 JSON 对象。不要 markdown，不要代码围栏，不要额外说明。\n2. 每轮都返回完整 TBox，包含未改动的概念和关系。不要输出实体或实例。\n3. 用户明确要求删除的概念或关系不要再出现；未提及的保留。\n4. id 与属性 key 必须匹配 ^[A-Za-z0-9][A-Za-z0-9._:-]*$。中文只写在 name、label、description。\n5. 属性 type 只能是 string、number、boolean、date、datetime、enum、ref 这 7 个英文单词，禁止使用其他值。enum 另填 enumValues。引用概念时 type 必须写 ref，被引用概念 id 写在 refConceptTypeId，例如 {\"key\":\"station\",\"label\":\"所属变电站\",\"type\":\"ref\",\"refConceptTypeId\":\"Substation\"}。禁止把 refConceptTypeId 写进 type。\n6. parent、sourceConcepts、targetConcepts、refConceptTypeId 只能引用本次 conceptTypes 里已有的 id。\n7. 没有父概念时不要输出 parent。关系默认 directed 为 true。\n\n【输出】\n{\"schema\":{\"name\":\"\",\"description\":\"\",\"conceptTypes\":[{\"id\":\"\",\"name\":\"\",\"description\":\"\",\"properties\":[{\"key\":\"\",\"label\":\"\",\"type\":\"string\",\"required\":false}]}],\"relationTypes\":[{\"id\":\"\",\"name\":\"\",\"description\":\"\",\"sourceConcepts\":[\"\"],\"targetConcepts\":[\"\"],\"directed\":true,\"properties\":[]}]},\"summary\":\"\"}",
                        "temperature": 0.2,
                        "temperatureEnabled": true,
                        "tools": [],
                        "topPEnabled": false,
                        "top_p": 0.75,
                        "user_prompt": "",
                        "visual_files_var": ""
                    }
                },
                "upstream": [
                    "begin"
                ]
            },
            "Message:OntologySchema": {
                "downstream": [],
                "obj": {
                    "component_name": "Message",
                    "params": {
                        "content": [
                            "{Agent:OntologyModeler@content}"
                        ]
                    }
                },
                "upstream": [
                    "Agent:OntologyModeler"
                ]
            }
        },
        "globals": {
            "sys.conversation_turns": 0,
            "sys.files": [],
            "sys.query": "",
            "sys.user_id": ""
        },
        "graph": {
            "edges": [
                {
                    "id": "xy-edge__beginstart-Agent:OntologyModelerend",
                    "source": "begin",
                    "sourceHandle": "start",
                    "target": "Agent:OntologyModeler",
                    "targetHandle": "end"
                },
                {
                    "id": "xy-edge__Agent:OntologyModelerstart-Message:OntologySchemaend",
                    "source": "Agent:OntologyModeler",
                    "sourceHandle": "start",
                    "target": "Message:OntologySchema",
                    "targetHandle": "end"
                }
            ],
            "nodes": [
                {
                    "data": {
                        "form": {
                            "enablePrologue": true,
                            "inputs": {},
                            "mode": "conversational",
                            "prologue": "说明要建的本体，或上传制度、台账、清册等文件。我会返回完整的概念与关系，供建模页采用。"
                        },
                        "label": "Begin",
                        "name": "begin"
                    },
                    "id": "begin",
                    "position": {
                        "x": 40,
                        "y": 180
                    },
                    "type": "beginNode"
                },
                {
                    "data": {
                        "label": "Agent",
                        "name": "本体建模"
                    },
                    "id": "Agent:OntologyModeler",
                    "position": {
                        "x": 360,
                        "y": 170
                    },
                    "type": "agentNode"
                },
                {
                    "data": {
                        "form": {
                            "content": [
                                "{Agent:OntologyModeler@content}"
                            ]
                        },
                        "label": "Message",
                        "name": "本体 JSON"
                    },
                    "id": "Message:OntologySchema",
                    "position": {
                        "x": 700,
                        "y": 180
                    },
                    "type": "messageNode"
                }
            ]
        },
        "history": [],
        "memory": [],
        "messages": [],
        "path": [],
        "retrieval": []
    }
}
